# Order + Payment State Transitions

This document defines all valid status transitions for **Order.Status** and **Order.PaymentStatus**.

## Status Transition Diagram

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph Order_Status["Order Status"]
        direction LR

        OP["PENDING"] -->|"confirm"| OC["CONFIRMED"]
        OP -->|"cancelOrder"| OX["CANCELLED"]

        OC -->|"ship"| OS["SHIPPED"]
        OC -->|"cancelOrder"| OX

        OS -->|"deliver"| OD["DELIVERED"]

        OD -->|"requestReturn"| ORQ["RETURN_REQUESTED"]
        ORQ -->|"completeReturn"| ORT["RETURNED"]
    end

    subgraph Payment_Status["Payment Status"]
        direction LR

        PP["PENDING"] -->|"processPayment"| IPA["PAID"]

        IPA -->|"requestRefund"| IPRQ["REFUND_REQUESTED"]
        IPRQ -->|"approveRefund"| IPR["REFUNDED"]
    end

    %% Cross-domain constraints
    IPA -.->|"required before shipping"| OS

    OX -.->|"may request refund if paid"| IPRQ
    ORQ -.->|"may request refund"| IPRQ

    style OP fill:#4CAF50,color:#fff
    style PP fill:#4CAF50,color:#fff

    style OX fill:#9E9E9E,color:#fff
    style ORT fill:#9E9E9E,color:#fff
    style IPR fill:#9E9E9E,color:#fff
```

### Legend

| Edge Style | Meaning |
|---|---|
| Solid arrow | Direct status transition within same domain |
| Dashed arrow | Cross-domain dependency or constraint |

## Order.Status Transitions

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    PENDING -->|"confirm"| CONFIRMED
    PENDING -->|"cancelOrder"| CANCELLED
    CONFIRMED -->|"ship"| SHIPPED
    CONFIRMED -->|"cancelOrder"| CANCELLED
    SHIPPED -->|"deliver"| DELIVERED
    DELIVERED -->|"requestReturn"| RETURN_REQUESTED
    RETURN_REQUESTED -->|"completeReturn"| RETURNED

    style PENDING fill:#4CAF50,color:#fff
    style CANCELLED fill:#9E9E9E,color:#fff
    style RETURNED fill:#9E9E9E,color:#fff
```

| From | To | Action | Guard |
|---|---|---|---|
| PENDING | CONFIRMED | `updateStatus(CONFIRMED)` | Valid transition |
| PENDING | CANCELLED | `cancelOrder()` | PaymentStatus must not be PAID |
| CONFIRMED | SHIPPED | `updateStatus(SHIPPED)` | PaymentStatus must be PAID |
| CONFIRMED | CANCELLED | `cancelOrder()` | PaymentStatus must not be PAID |
| SHIPPED | DELIVERED | `updateStatus(DELIVERED)` | Valid transition |
| DELIVERED | RETURN_REQUESTED | `requestReturn()` | Not already requested |
| RETURN_REQUESTED | RETURNED | `updateStatus(RETURNED)` | Valid transition |

**Terminal states:** CANCELLED, RETURNED (no outgoing transitions)

## Order.PaymentStatus Transitions

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    PENDING -->|"processPayment"| PAID
    PAID -->|"requestRefund"| REFUND_REQUESTED
    REFUND_REQUESTED -->|"approveRefund"| REFUNDED

    style PENDING fill:#4CAF50,color:#fff
    style REFUNDED fill:#9E9E9E,color:#fff
```

| From | To | Action | Guard |
|---|---|---|---|
| PENDING | PAID | `processPayment()` | Card approved, order not CANCELLED/RETURNED |
| PAID | REFUND_REQUESTED | `requestRefund()` | Order status must be RETURN_REQUESTED, RETURNED, or CANCELLED |
| REFUND_REQUESTED | REFUNDED | `approveRefund()` | Refund approved by system/admin |

**Terminal state:** REFUNDED (no outgoing transitions)

## Payment.PaymentStatus Transitions

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    PENDING -->|"approved"| COMPLETED
    PENDING -->|"declined"| FAILED
    COMPLETED -->|"refund"| REFUNDED

    style PENDING fill:#4CAF50,color:#fff
    style FAILED fill:#9E9E9E,color:#fff
    style REFUNDED fill:#9E9E9E,color:#fff
```

| From | To | Action | Guard |
|---|---|---|---|
| PENDING | COMPLETED | `mockAuthorize()` returns true | Card valid |
| PENDING | FAILED | `mockAuthorize()` returns false | Card ending 0002 |
| COMPLETED | REFUNDED | `requestRefund()` | Order in RETURN_REQUESTED/RETURNED/CANCELLED |

**Terminal states:** FAILED, REFUNDED (no outgoing transitions)

## Cross-Domain Dependencies

| Dependency | From | To | Meaning |
|---|---|---|---|
| Shipping guard | PAID | SHIPPED | Order cannot be shipped unless PaymentStatus = PAID |
| Refund trigger (return) | RETURN_REQUESTED | REFUND_REQUESTED | Refund allowed when order is RETURN_REQUESTED |
| Refund trigger (cancel) | CANCELLED | REFUND_REQUESTED | Refund allowed when order is CANCELLED (if paid) |
| Return guard | DELIVERED | RETURN_REQUESTED | Return only allowed from DELIVERED status |

## Canonical Paths

### Happy Path (Place → Pay → Deliver → Return → Refund)
```
PENDING ──confirm──> CONFIRMED ──ship──> SHIPPED ──deliver──> DELIVERED
                                                                   │
PENDING ──processPayment──> PAID                              requestReturn
                                                                   │
                                                            RETURN_REQUESTED
                                                                   │
PAID ──requestRefund──> REFUND_REQUESTED ──approveRefund──> REFUNDED
                                                                   │
                                                            completeReturn
                                                                   │
                                                              RETURNED
```

### Cancel Before Payment
```
PENDING ──cancelOrder──> CANCELLED (terminal)
```

### Cancel After Payment (with refund)
```
PENDING ──processPayment──> PAID
PAID ──cancelOrder──> CANCELLED
PAID ──requestRefund──> REFUND_REQUESTED ──approveRefund──> REFUNDED
```

### Confirm Then Cancel
```
PENDING ──confirm──> CONFIRMED ──cancelOrder──> CANCELLED (terminal)
```
